; ..\src\BaseSw\MCAL\McalLib\ssc\src\McalLib.c	  1741  **                    Applications can retrieve a base tick count, add the    **
; ..\src\BaseSw\MCAL\McalLib\ssc\src\McalLib.c	  1742  **                    desired delay to the base tick count and arrive at a    **
; ..\src\BaseSw\MCAL\McalLib\ssc\src\McalLib.c	  1743  **                    terminal tick count. Applications can also then         **
